   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "1990-07-10",
   "text": "Medicaid Nursing Home Reform Act of 1990 - Amends title XIX (Medicaid) of the Social Security Act to revise Medicaid requirements imposed on nursing facilities by the Omnibus Budget Reconciliation Act of 1987, particularly nurse aide training and preadmission screening and annual resident review requirements."
